From 8b6f9a17cb65e8af09bb7a3d79de16b84c873576 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Can Basaran <basaran.can@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:19:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] improve: port of 018138f onto the pinned lane runner 1270c04:
 a 200 reply carrying a provider error (top-level error, choices[0].error,
 finish_reason error) is a failed attempt, retried like a 5xx; out of retries
 it fails the decision as transport, never invalid (QC 2026-11-12
 D1/D2-DeepSeek, #926). Conflict in http::send_until resolved keeping the
 improve guard (quota_fatal 429 stays fatal for non-error-reply statuses);
 test helper adapted to the improve Options/Player fields. Request bytes
 unchanged. Tests: Rust 83 passed.

(cherry picked from commit 018138fe40038410561ac5e67998777fc01ff175)

